Your analysis of what happens is correct.

=I don't know how to do this within C on a VAX (I have never tried it).

You could use freopen(), or, before you do any I/O to stdout, you could
redefine SYS$OUTPUT, either via the SYS$CRELNM system service (which, for an
unprivileged user, will make a user-mode definition), or via
LIB$SET_LOGICAL (which will create a supervisor-mode definition).
